  "rules": {
    "summary": "WNBL27: 9 teams (the Tasmania Jewels join), 22 games each, 99 games from 15 October 2026 to 31 January 2027. The ladder ranks by win percentage, then points percentage (WNBL26 rule; WNBL25 used head-to-head). Five teams make the Finals: 4th hosts 5th in a one-off Eliminator whose winner plays 1st in a best-of-three semi-final, 2nd plays 3rd in the other, and the winners meet in a best-of-three Championship Series. The higher place hosts games 1 and 3 of a series (as in the WNBL26 finals).",
